  30:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * @section DESCRIPTION
  31:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  *
  32:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * The GetEventInformation service is used by a client BACnet-user to obtain
  33:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * a summary of all "active event states". The term "active event states"
  34:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * refers to all event-initiating objects that have an Event_State property
  35:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * whose value is not equal to NORMAL, or have an Acked_Transitions property,
  36:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * which has at least one of the bits (TO-OFFNORMAL, TO-FAULT, TONORMAL)
  37:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  * set to FALSE.
  38:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_event.c ****  */
